# API

- Prefix stays `/api/v1`. Do not invent paths or fields missing from `docs/api/swagger.yaml`.
- Lists use `page` and `limit`, maximum 100.
- Error JSON uses `error.code`, `error.message`, optional `details`, and `request_id`.
- Localize `message` only. Keep field names, enums, and status codes stable.
- Swagger decorators must match `docs/api/swagger.yaml`. Permission names come from `docs/product/USER_ROLES_AND_PERMISSIONS.md`.
